    "detailed_description": "Daugger is an 8-bit adventure about a dog named Olive exploring &amp; using her snoot to sniff out information, and peeing on every piece of ground she can. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nSolve problems in different types of neighborhood. Use scent to read messages left by other dogs. Maybe even be a little stinker and cause some trouble now and then. Battle over grassy lots with Prince Crimson. Scour dusty desert for signs of life. Seek out solutions to other dogs' conundrums. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis top-down adventure features an amazing original chip-tune soundtrack of beautiful melodies. You may be tempted to put scrounging around on the back burner, and just listen. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nDaugger features no combat, damage, or death. It's a relaxing game that can be enjoyed at any age. Reading is not required, but does enhance the experience. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnjoy this love letter to pets everywhere.",
    "about_the_game": "Daugger is an 8-bit adventure about a dog named Olive exploring &amp; using her snoot to sniff out information, and peeing on every piece of ground she can. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nSolve problems in different types of neighborhood. Use scent to read messages left by other dogs. Maybe even be a little stinker and cause some trouble now and then. Battle over grassy lots with Prince Crimson. Scour dusty desert for signs of life. Seek out solutions to other dogs' conundrums. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis top-down adventure features an amazing original chip-tune soundtrack of beautiful melodies. You may be tempted to put scrounging around on the back burner, and just listen. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nDaugger features no combat, damage, or death. It's a relaxing game that can be enjoyed at any age. Reading is not required, but does enhance the experience. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnjoy this love letter to pets everywhere.",
    "short_description": "A non-combat oriented adventure game about a dog named Olive, exploring, claiming territory, and solving problems to trigger bizarre events. Daugger is a relaxing and casual love letter to pets, suitable for all ages.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
